{"info_box":"<div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12 ui-resizable\" data-type=\"container-content\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: center;\" data-type=\"component-text\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>CHI B\u1ed8 NH\u00c0 LAO PLEIKU<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"component-text\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>S\u01a1 l\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ecbch s\u1eed:<\/i><\/b> \u1ede trong nh\u00e0 t\u00f9 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ea3ng vi\u00ean t\u1ef1 t\u1eadp h\u1ee3p l\u1ea1i, th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp chi b\u1ed9 nh\u00e0 lao v\u00e0o th\u00e1ng 6 n\u0103m 1948 v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u00eam \u0111\u1ea3ng vi\u00ean m\u1edbi. Chi b\u1ed9 l\u00fac \u0111\u1ea7u g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed3ng ch\u00ed L\u01b0\u01a1ng T\u00e2n (Kim Anh), \u0110\u00e0o L\u1ee5t, Nguy\u1ec5n Ngh\u0129a,&nbsp;Nguy\u1ec5n Thu\u1ea5n, sau k\u1ebft n\u1ea1p c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed3ng ch\u00ed Nguy\u1ec5n \u0110\u00e0n, Ho\u00e0ng V\u0103n Ng\u1ecdc, Tr\u1ea7n Minh ... Chi b\u1ed9 do \u0111\u1ed3ng ch\u00ed L\u01b0\u01a1ng T\u00e2n l\u00e0m B\u00ed th\u01b0. \u0110\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 1950, \u0111\u1ecbch \u0111\u01b0a m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00f9 ch\u00ednh tr\u1ecb \u1edf lao Kon Tum \u0111\u1ebfn Pleiku, trong \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 anh H\u1ed3 Ho\u00e0n l\u00e0 c\u00e1n b\u1ed9 qu\u00e2n \u0111\u1ed9i v\u00e0 l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3ng vi\u00ean c\u1ed9ng s\u1ea3n. L\u00fac n\u00e0y anh H\u1ed3 Ho\u00e0n l\u00e0m B\u00ed th\u01b0, anh L\u01b0\u01a1ng T\u00e2n l\u00e0m Ph\u00f3 B\u00ed th\u01b0. Chi b\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ec1 ra nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ee5: l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o t\u00f9 nh\u00e2n \u0111o\u00e0n k\u1ebft \u0111\u1ea5u tranh ch\u1ed1ng ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 h\u00e0 kh\u1eafc c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ecbch; b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; gi\u1eef g\u00ecn ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi chi\u1ebfn s\u0129 qu\u00e2n \u0111\u1ed9i v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00e1n b\u1ed9 c\u00e1ch m\u1ea1ng; khi c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n th\u00ec t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c v\u01b0\u1ee3t ng\u1ee5c v\u1ec1 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng. Chi b\u1ed9 ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng anh em ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac v\u1edbi s\u0129 quan binh l\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c binh v\u1eadn. M\u1ed9t nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ee5 c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t ra ngay t\u1eeb d\u1ea7u l\u00e0 quan b\u1ec7 v\u1edbi qu\u1ea7n ch\u00fang b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i, m\u00f3c n\u1ed1i x\u00e2y d\u01b0ng c\u01a1 s\u1edf \u1edf th\u1ecb x\u00e3.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\" data-type=\"component-text\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>\u0110\u01a1n v\u1ecb<\/i><\/b>: \u0110o\u00e0n ph\u01b0\u1eddng Di\u00ean H\u1ed3ng<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\" data-type=\"component-text\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>C\u00e1n b\u1ed9 ph\u1ee5 tr\u00e1ch cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin<\/i><\/b>: Cao V\u0103n S\u1ef9<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\" data-type=\"component-text\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>S\u0110T<\/i><\/b>:&nbsp;0865398067<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\" data-type=\"component-text\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>N\u0103m th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp<\/i><\/b>:&nbsp;6\/1\/1948<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\" data-type=\"component-text\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>\u0110\u1ecba \u0111i\u1ec3m hi\u1ec7n nay<\/i><\/b> (Ghi c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 theo \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb h\u00e0nh ch\u00ednh m\u1edbi):&nbsp;Nh\u00e0 lao Pleiku<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\" data-type=\"component-text\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>Website<\/i><\/b> <b><i>https: <\/i><\/b><i><a href=\"https:\/\/baotanglichsu.vn\/vi\/Articles\/3096\/71605\/ghe-tham-khu-di-tich-nha-lao-pleiku-chung-tich-hao-hung-trong-lich-su-dan-toc.html\" style=\"color:#467886; text-decoration:underline\">https:\/\/baotanglichsu.vn\/vi\/Articles\/3096\/71605\/ghe-tham-khu-di-tich-nha-lao-pleiku-chung-tich-hao-hung-trong-lich-su-dan-toc.html<\/a><\/i><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n        <\/div>","info_box_type":"popup"}